    "name": "Talents",
    "steam_appid": 2528800,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528800/extras/704a72996de18618b0644e4468069130.webp?t=1752559241\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an aspiring game writer and designer who dives into a business partnership with a rowdy crew of talented co-founders, aiming to conquer the indie game development industry through their shared stories, love, and relentless determination. Will you write your way to the top? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528800/extras/5f13e8f8ed2b5a4e8315fc2446ecfa73.avif?t=1752559241\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renamable protagonist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A game with unique game mechanics:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a01. Writing Skill Event (Mini-Game)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 -- Pass to unlock routes and progress the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 -- Fail, and you\u2019ll get different bad endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 -- Determines your love interest and affects key scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a02. Choice Selection</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 -- Your choices change events, scenes, and the type of ending you\u2019ll get.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>100k+ word</strong> fictional tale inspired by real-life dev experiences, interviews, and events \u2014 with multiple routes and endings that offer hours of replayable content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six routes in total. Four </strong>romanceable routes\u00a0(Composer, Artist, Programmer, CEO) and <strong>two </strong>extra routes (Alexis and Otome)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings where you could replay<strong> (19 in total\u2014</strong>ranging from<i><strong> bad, normal, </strong></i>and <i><strong>good endings)</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English voice acting (Prologue is fully voiced, while the rest of the full game has partial voice acting)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CG Gallery <strong>(Over 50+ in total)</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dictionary feature for some technical and gaming words.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam and In-game Achievements (However, only Steam has a dedicated list. You can also\u00a0 see your progress on the <i>Endings</i> feature.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music Room</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus Content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More features are available for the player to discover.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528800/extras/da05387b75b49724938f77dcbd47445b.avif?t=1752559241\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Alice</strong> <i>(Renamable)</i>, the main character of our game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528800/extras/9a3b1a694f1400e20b04051bdbbbcdbe.avif?t=1752559241\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And meet your team/love interests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528800/extras/35fcb44f9b44666822d0c95346a818ba.avif?t=1752559241\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528800/extras/59c79a5005c290a9642821378d9dfbfa.avif?t=1752559241\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528800/extras/1c21996e3d3a5e2b1fe6a655a3012bbc.avif?t=1752559241\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528800/extras/7542c9aa1703c21536f6f01e879dbd44.avif?t=1752559241\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Before you start</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>Recommended route order: Composer &gt; Artist &gt; Programmer &gt; CEO &gt; Alexis &gt; Otome</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>For the best experience, we recommend this order as it preserves the intended narrative flow and reveals.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u26a0\ufe0f Linux &amp; Steam Deck Disclaimer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is not officially supported on Linux/Steam Deck, as we currently do not have the hardware to properly test or troubleshoot issues. However, some players have reported successful gameplay after adjusting compatibility settings (e.g., using Proton 5.13-6 on Steam Deck).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We recommend trying the demo first to check compatibility. If the demo runs smoothly, the full game should work as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Credits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Izumi (The Solo Dev)</strong> -\u00a0Art Director,\u00a0Background Artist, UI Designer, Extra Graphics Artist, Writer, CG colorist, Programmer, Marketer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In collaboration with:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30c6\u30eb <i>(Kuroaya Craft)</i> -\u00a0Sprites and Character Designs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ysa Sensei -\u00a0CG outline artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mingming.ix- CG colorist, sprite artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art of Ersuke - Modified Sprites (except Alice's)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >xLyn - chibi artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hanabiem\u00a0-\u00a0Key Art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limnological -\u00a0Co-programmer for Writing Skill Event - Level 1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VPG Studio\u00a0-\u00a0Voice Acting, Casting, Voice Direction, Voice Audio Engineering. See imdb for full list of cast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NetherTales- Pangarap Game Jam Scene Animation</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CC Music, SFX, and BG Model Creators - listed on the game application's credits section</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528800/extras/704a72996de18618b0644e4468069130.webp?t=1752559241\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an aspiring game writer and designer who dives into a business partnership with a rowdy crew of talented co-founders, aiming to conquer the indie game development industry through their shared stories, love, and relentless determination. Will you write your way to the top? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528800/extras/5f13e8f8ed2b5a4e8315fc2446ecfa73.avif?t=1752559241\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renamable protagonist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A game with unique game mechanics:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a01. Writing Skill Event (Mini-Game)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 -- Pass to unlock routes and progress the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 -- Fail, and you\u2019ll get different bad endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 -- Determines your love interest and affects key scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a02. Choice Selection</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 -- Your choices change events, scenes, and the type of ending you\u2019ll get.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>100k+ word</strong> fictional tale inspired by real-life dev experiences, interviews, and events \u2014 with multiple routes and endings that offer hours of replayable content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six routes in total. Four </strong>romanceable routes\u00a0(Composer, Artist, Programmer, CEO) and <strong>two </strong>extra routes (Alexis and Otome)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings where you could replay<strong> (19 in total\u2014</strong>ranging from<i><strong> bad, normal, </strong></i>and <i><strong>good endings)</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English voice acting (Prologue is fully voiced, while the rest of the full game has partial voice acting)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CG Gallery <strong>(Over 50+ in total)</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dictionary feature for some technical and gaming words.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam and In-game Achievements (However, only Steam has a dedicated list. You can also\u00a0 see your progress on the <i>Endings</i> feature.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music Room</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus Content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More features are available for the player to discover.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528800/extras/da05387b75b49724938f77dcbd47445b.avif?t=1752559241\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Alice</strong> <i>(Renamable)</i>, the main character of our game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528800/extras/9a3b1a694f1400e20b04051bdbbbcdbe.avif?t=1752559241\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And meet your team/love interests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528800/extras/35fcb44f9b44666822d0c95346a818ba.avif?t=1752559241\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528800/extras/59c79a5005c290a9642821378d9dfbfa.avif?t=1752559241\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528800/extras/1c21996e3d3a5e2b1fe6a655a3012bbc.avif?t=1752559241\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2528800/extras/7542c9aa1703c21536f6f01e879dbd44.avif?t=1752559241\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Before you start</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>Recommended route order: Composer &gt; Artist &gt; Programmer &gt; CEO &gt; Alexis &gt; Otome</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>For the best experience, we recommend this order as it preserves the intended narrative flow and reveals.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u26a0\ufe0f Linux &amp; Steam Deck Disclaimer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is not officially supported on Linux/Steam Deck, as we currently do not have the hardware to properly test or troubleshoot issues. However, some players have reported successful gameplay after adjusting compatibility settings (e.g., using Proton 5.13-6 on Steam Deck).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We recommend trying the demo first to check compatibility. If the demo runs smoothly, the full game should work as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Credits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Izumi (The Solo Dev)</strong> -\u00a0Art Director,\u00a0Background Artist, UI Designer, Extra Graphics Artist, Writer, CG colorist, Programmer, Marketer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In collaboration with:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30c6\u30eb <i>(Kuroaya Craft)</i> -\u00a0Sprites and Character Designs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ysa Sensei -\u00a0CG outline artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mingming.ix- CG colorist, sprite artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art of Ersuke - Modified Sprites (except Alice's)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >xLyn - chibi artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hanabiem\u00a0-\u00a0Key Art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limnological -\u00a0Co-programmer for Writing Skill Event - Level 1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VPG Studio\u00a0-\u00a0Voice Acting, Casting, Voice Direction, Voice Audio Engineering. See imdb for full list of cast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NetherTales- Pangarap Game Jam Scene Animation</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CC Music, SFX, and BG Model Creators - listed on the game application's credits section</p></li></ul>",
